                "retweet_count": 194,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From the rising costs of health care and prescription drugs to Ted Cruz\u2019s near-total abortion ban. Texans are facing a lot. But there\u2019s more that unites us than divides us. In the Senate, I\u2019ll bring us together and work to tackle those issues for all 30 million Texans.",
