                "retweet_count": 262,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Texas women and health care providers are bearing the brunt of Ted Cruz\u2019s abortion ban. Today, I held a roundtable with @alexismcgill, @LeToyaLuckett, & @ReverendWarnock to hear directly from those impacted by this ban.\n\nTexas women can count on me to restore their freedoms. https://t.co/G8p7UUSJoF",
