                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My heart breaks for the Barnica family. Josseli Barnica should be alive today but because of Ted Cruz\u2019s cruel abortion ban, Texas women have been denied the life-saving health care they need.\n\nWe can\u2019t afford six more years of Ted Cruz. https://t.co/IdT6sy6CoQ",
