                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Cecile Richards was a remarkable trailblazer not just for Texas, but for our nation. She fought for women\u2019s health and equity fearlessly. Aly and I are heartbroken to hear of her passing and we pray that her family finds peace and comfort in their memories. https://t.co/x3m8RILjz7",
