                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 47,
                "retweet_count": 95,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "John Cornyn and his friends just voted to defund Planned Parenthood\u2014ripping health care away from millions of Texas women. Cancer screenings, birth control, life-saving care\u2014all on the chopping block so billionaires can get another tax break.\n\nTexans deserve a fighter in the Senate who fights for them, not for billionaires.",
