                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 30,
                "retweet_count": 87,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Let's be very clear: the bill passed by John Cornyn and championed by Ken Paxton will make life more expensive for Texans. It\u2019s going to kick more than 1 million Texans off their health care. It\u2019s going to raise health care premiums. It\u2019s going to raise energy costs by $800 a year.",
