                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 19,
                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Glad to have attended mass this morning with the folks at Holy Cross High School here in San Antonio. As a man of faith, I\u2019m in this race to fight for a future where seniors can afford their medications, working families can get by, and women can make their own health care decisions alongside their families.",
