                "reply_count": 14,
                "retweet_count": 49,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans promised to protect seniors. Instead, they\u2019re shoving greedy corporations and AI middlemen between Texans and their doctors. \n\nThat\u2019s not protection \u2014 it\u2019s a sellout. \n\nI\u2019ll fight like hell to protect Texans\u2019 health care.",
