                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Together, we fought to lower costs, expand access to health care, and ensure every community has a voice in our democracy.\n\nWashington is broken \u2014 too often it only works for those willing to bend the rules for themselves.\n\nThat's why I'll fight to unrig this system and deliver real results for hardworking Texans.\n\nIf you\u2019re ready to join us in the fight, visit https://t.co/gjUD12Pw0G.",
